# Desktop-only Rust, carried over from upstream `windows/`. None of it can build
# here — there is no cargo in this toolchain, which is why the npm `prebuild`
# cargo hook was removed from package.json. Left on disk so the tree still matches
# upstream for reference, but kept out of the Android repo: a 140 kB Cargo.lock
# plus 31 files of dead Tauri/Rust host would otherwise ship in every clone.
src-tauri/
hook/
Cargo.toml
Cargo.lock
dev/

# Generated by tauri-build on every compile
src-tauri/gen/schemas/

# Local secrets and overrides — never committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
